hich we keeps the pairs, we obtain the final complexity "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/eac1a6f012e64522b10b7f9d5dbc3174a35c46e7f0540a4760d1231d3d6fa203.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":". Also, map can be replaced with binary search, but the complexity remains the same."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"problem_section"}],"kind":"document"},"schema":2,"sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/blog/entry/55734"}